## Code map

See `CLAUDE.md` for full architectural rules. The module dependency direction is `Features → Core → External`. Never invert.

## Style

- 2-space indent
- Explicit access control
- `@Observable @MainActor` for ViewModels
- `async/await` only — no `DispatchQueue`
- Sorted imports
- No `print` / `fatalError` / force-unwrap

## Don't

- Don't edit `*.xcodeproj` or `*.xcworkspace` — regenerate from `__CONFIG_FILE__`
- Don't introduce UIKit, Storyboards, or XIBs — SwiftUI only
- Don't add `// swiftlint:disable` — fix the root cause
- Don't introduce a new external dependency without first checking if `Foundation` / `Swift` standard library covers it
